    {
      "source": "Hashcode typically derives from the <a href=\"Segment.html#toString()\"><code>Segment.toString()</code></a> representation so two <a href=\"Segment.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Segment</code></a>s yield the same\n<a href=\"Segment.html#hashCode()\"><code>Segment.hashCode()</code></a> if their <a href=\"Segment.html#toString()\"><code>Segment.toString()</code></a> representation matches.",
